PTX 2+add.cta+diff-cta
"As 2+add.gpu at .cta scope in different CTAs: not morally strong, so atomicity does not apply. Expected: allowed."
{
x=0;
P0:r0=0;
P1:r1=0;
}
 P0@cta 0,gpu 0                | P1@cta 1,gpu 0                ;
 atom.relaxed.cta.add r0, x, 1 | atom.relaxed.cta.add r1, x, 1 ;
exists
(P0:r0 == 0 /\ P1:r1 == 0)
